{% macro diagnosis__icd10_block(code_column) %}
{#
    ICD-10 block for a diagnosis code, labelled "<first code>-<last code> <block title>"
    (e.g. 'J09-J18 Influenza and pneumonia'), the level below diagnosis__icd10_chapter.

    Labels are the block set data-staging's icd_grouping macro (diagnosis_icd_category)
    emitted, which earlier Tupaia dashboards were built on, so a card moved onto a metric__
    model keeps its categories. Each block matches the range its own label names.

    Matching is on the first three characters of the code, upper-cased -- see
    diagnosis__icd10_chapter for why a plain text `between` is enough and an integer cast
    would be worse. diagnosis__icd10_obstetric_block draws chapter XV's blocks the same way
    and labels a code outside it 'Non-obstetric'; this macro covers every chapter.

    Parameters:
    - code_column: SQL expression yielding an ICD-10 code (Tamanu reference_data.code).

    Returns: CASE expression producing the block label, or 'Unclassified' when the code is
    null, malformed, or falls outside every block.
#}
    case
        when left(upper({{ code_column }}), 3) between 'A00' and 'A09' then 'A00-A09 Intestinal infectious diseases'
        when left(upper({{ code_column }}), 3) between 'A15' and 'A19' then 'A15-A19 Tuberculosis'
        when left(upper({{ code_column }}), 3) between 'A20' and 'A28' then 'A20-A28 Certain zoonotic bacterial diseases'
        when left(upper({{ code_column }}), 3) between 'A30' and 'A49' then 'A30-A49 Other bacterial diseases'
        when left(upper({{ code_column }}), 3) between 'A50' and 'A64' then 'A50-A64 Infections with a predominantly sexual mode of transmission'
        when left(upper({{ code_column }}), 3) between 'A65' and 'A69' then 'A65-A69 Other spirochaetal diseases'
        when left(upper({{ code_column }}), 3) between 'A70' and 'A74' then 'A70-A74 Other diseases caused by chlamydiae'
        when left(upper({{ code_column }}), 3) between 'A75' and 'A79' then 'A75-A79 Rickettsioses'
        when left(upper({{ code_column }}), 3) between 'A80' and 'A89' then 'A80-A89 Viral infections of the central nervous system'
